		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — A trusty wrench that doubles as a turret recall tool.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action · Considered a mace.</strong> Reach 1, Damage: 1d6+STR Bludgeoning. If you target your turret, you undeploy it and regain its Toolbelt scrap.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Target is Dazed, 3 turns, or the turret lasts +3 rounds.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Turrets can be Tiny.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Tool Wrench gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Tool Wrench (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Passive: Your turrets can be Tiny.</em></p>",
